Create a `Resource` that fetches data with the configured HTTP request.
The resource will update when the request changes via signals.
Uses [`HttpClient`](/api/common/http/HttpClient) to make requests and supports interceptors, testing, and the other features
of the [`HttpClient`](/api/common/http/HttpClient) API. Data is parsed as JSON by default - use a sub-function of
[`httpResource`](/api/common/http/httpResource), such as [`httpResource.text()`](/api/common/http/httpResource), to parse the response differently.
